    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Backtracking</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Dedup by sorting</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/combination-sum-ii/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 40</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Combination Sum II</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Sort the cards, then fill a combination one slot at a time with dfs(start, left). Each card is used once (recurse with i + 1), a card bigger than what is left ends the loop (break), and inside one slot an equal value is tried only once (skip i &gt; start with a[i] == a[i-1]). That single skip rule removes duplicate combinations without any set.</p>\n"
  },
